<title>USA: Benihana Q4 diluted shr $0.22 vs $0.21.</title>
<headline>Benihana Q4 diluted shr $0.22 vs $0.21.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BENIHANA, INC.</p>
<p>Financial Highlights (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		For the Three Periods Ended  For the Year Ended</p>
<p>		     3/30/97  3/30/96 (a)     3/31/97 3/31/96 (a)</p>
<p> Revenues    $20,597,000  $21,267,000 $85,204,000 $81,606,000</p>
